  "description": "BUCMOC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C8 H20 N1 O2 1+,C100 H200 Mn5 N8 O64 Tb8 1-,6(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb7 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb8 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn3 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn4 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn5 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 24 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.407-4.176 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.32-118.79°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C120H238Mn5N15O66Tb8. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 12 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
